<title>UK: Ashquay extends bid for UK Estates to Jan 13.</title>
<headline>Ashquay extends bid for UK Estates to Jan 13.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Ashquay Group Plc said on Tuesday it had extended its hostile bid for property development firm UK Estates Plc to 1300 GMT on January 13.</p>
<p>Ashquay also said it owned or had acceptances for 38 percent of UK Estates' ordinary share capital, little changed from the level it reported on December 20.</p>
<p>The company said the new deadline for its bid, which offered 10 shares for every 13 ordinary UK Estates shares, was final.</p>
<p>UK Estates has repeatedly rejected the offer.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
